# Chapter VI, the desert: Calisto's friends join the player near Almasanoar,
# the captain of the guard brings the player to the Sultan, and the player
# drives the Mytrehen from the old Normaden outpost.
# Position stands in for the walks and damage for the fight; ref FormIDs carry
# Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from desert_friends
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Calisto and his friends wait in the stone desert.
case desert_friends
run
player->Position 48574 -100700 193 0
talk WusteCalisto02
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VI_AlmasanoarFreunde == 1
end

# The captain of the guard stops the player: the Sultan wants to see them.
case desert_captain
run
player->Position 50847 -106990 1161 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VI_SultansAufgabe == 1
end

# The Sultan asks for help against the Mytrehen; the player agrees.
case desert_sultan
run
player->Position 48234 -107600 1502 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
ask against the Mytrehen
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VI_SultansAufgabe == 11
wait 30
expect "AlmasanoarHauptmann"->GetDistance "AlmasanoarSultan" < 1500
end

# The captain has found a few brave men.
case desert_men
run
player->Position 49033 -107620 1512 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_VI_SultansAufgabe == 16
end

# The Mytrehen leader at the old outpost. Taking the Sultan's task set
# Mytrehen to 10, so he attacks rather than greets; his death is the entry.
case desert_outpost
run
player->Position 42825 -150450 3240 0
expect Mytrehen == 10
wait 60
console 05EB0A10.damageav health 100000
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_VI_SultansAufgabe == 21
end
